{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026cKmiFKWmXz1795419283.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產火炭站銀禧花園分行分區營業經理吳嘉權表示，近日租賃交投持續正面，火炭新晉屋苑星凱．堤岸最新錄5座中層B室，單位實用面積492平方呎，2房間隔，議價後以26,000元租出，實用平均呎租約52.8元。</p><p><br/>據了解，新租客為同區客，見屋苑環境舒適，價錢合理，單位間隔合用，即決定租入單位自住。據了解，業主於2021年以956萬元購入單位，是次租出單位可享3.3厘租金回報。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T09:23:57.945979+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":185,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T08:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T11:17:17.644798+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T09:17:18.644679+00:00","content_hash":"8f1d63993c20ada0af586c1a5e6c02d39232407ddf5cf79372d8427c23b64729","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T09:23:57.945979+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}